#: ../../source/docs/modules/speech.rst:3 9529b2d558364961ad998d5ee898c332
msgid "Text-to-Speech"
msgstr "文字转语音"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/speech.rst:9 7a7e5683239b413cbb78923d4569eed6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Activates the text-to-speech function. It will \"say\" any important "
"announcements throughout the flight using the system default sound "
"hardware."
msgstr "激活文字转语音功能，在飞行中使用系统默认声音硬件「朗读」重要公告。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/speech.rst:14 0ddb48ebb47d41a6b13abdbe2d59fe3b
msgid ""
"On some systems, the \"python-espeak\" or \"python3-speechd\" package may"
" be required."
msgstr "在某些系统上，可能需要安装 「python-espeak」 或 「python3-speechd」 包。"

